/**
 * ============================================================================
 * 3D VIEWPORT STORE (ROADMAP Phases 3D-012, 3D-014, 3D-018)
 * ============================================================================
 * Shared Zustand store for the 3D viewport state:
 *   - settings: ViewportSettings (shading modes, overlays, cavity, x-ray)
